WEBVTT


00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:03.246
Can I have a shot glass, please?


00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:00.873
<i>Photo sent.</i>


00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:19.914
<i>Stay on this heading for about 6h30min.</i>


00:03:20.014 --> 00:03:21.614
<i>Turn left at the
Aurora Borealis.</i>


00:03:21.714 --> 00:03:24.986
<i>When you see something that looks like
a frozen gall bladder, that's Greenland.</i>


00:03:25.086 --> 00:03:26.163
<i>Hang a soft right there.</i>


00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:29.502
<i>- All set there, Mr. Hauser?
- Yeah, thank you.</i>


00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:30.965
<i>Guidestar!</i>


00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:48.673
<i>Guidestar!</i>


00:03:48.773 --> 00:03:49.909
<i>Welcome back.</i>


00:03:50.009 --> 00:03:53.022
<i>Hotel? Dinner reservations?
Movie tickets, maybe?</i>


00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:58.492
<i>Mr. Hauser
Is there something else you need?</i>


00:03:59.339 --> 00:04:02.467
I don't know.
I feel...


00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:05.573
<i>Go on.</i>


00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:08.580
Like a refuge from the
Island of Dr. Moreau.


00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:13.383
Some morally inverted, twisted
character from a Céline novel.


00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:15.731
The hot sauce helps.


00:04:15.831 --> 00:04:17.970
<i>You still getting those
nightmares you told me about?</i>


00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:20.924
They're coming back faster and faster. I
don't know if I can keep outrunning 'em.


00:04:25.565 --> 00:04:26.881
That'll be it, Jerry.
I gotta go.


00:04:26.981 --> 00:04:29.582
<i>You bet, Mr. Hauser. GuideStar
wants you to feel secure.</i>


00:04:29.682 --> 00:04:30.660
<i>GuideStar.</i>


00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:33.237
Be still my trembling hands,
for how you would tremble...


00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:35.500
if you knew where I
would take you next.


00:04:38.878 --> 00:04:40.175
<i>Incoming message.</i>


00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:42.547
<i>Incoming message.</i>


00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:48.077
<i>You got him on the comm there?
Bring it over.</i>


00:04:48.821 --> 00:04:49.788
<i>Hello, Hauser!</i>


00:04:50.189 --> 00:04:51.337
Hello, Mr. Vice President.


00:04:51.437 --> 00:04:53.573
I haven't been vice president
for five months.


00:04:53.673 --> 00:04:55.560
Otherwise, this all might
be a conflict of interest.


00:04:56.829 --> 00:05:00.148
Tamerlane and the U.S. government,
and I in particular, were cleared...


00:05:00.248 --> 00:05:02.724
<i>of any and all violations of federal,
state and international laws...</i>


00:05:02.869 --> 00:05:04.680
<i>by the bipartisan committee.</i>


00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.295
Just read the report.


00:05:06.406 --> 00:05:09.522
I'm sure anything you weren't supposed
to be doing you were cleared of.


00:05:09.622 --> 00:05:12.510
And of course I was preemptively
pardoned by the president.


00:05:13.546 --> 00:05:15.741
I got the snapshots.
Love your work.


00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:18.339
- We're all big fans.
- Yes.


00:05:18.451 --> 00:05:19.902
Let's see if the
damn Krauts...


00:05:20.002 --> 00:05:22.648
will cross us in the
Security Council now.


00:05:23.289 --> 00:05:25.086
We seem to be heading southeast.
Where am I going?


00:05:25.191 --> 00:05:26.852
Hope you like the smell
of fresh liberation.


00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.022
Give me a sec.


00:05:29.896 --> 00:05:32.160
I gotta growler down there
the size of a cane frog.


00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:36.864
Turaqistan.


00:05:37.537 --> 00:05:38.362
What's the gig?


00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.004
<i>Omar Sharif.</i>


00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:43.737
<i>- Omar Sharif?
- Yeah.</i>


00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:46.893
<i>The CEO of Ugi Gas, the
Ugikistani conglomerate.</i>


00:05:46.993 --> 00:05:50.745
<i>He is building a pipeline
through his country.</i>


00:05:51.351 --> 00:05:54.787
<i>We didn't liberate Turaqistan
to get hustled by a fez head.</i>


00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:56.177
<i>Terminate.</i>


00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:58.316
<i>Do do that voodoo
that you do so well.</i>


00:05:58.758 --> 00:06:01.352
You'll be working directly under the
viceroy just appointed by the president.


00:06:01.461 --> 00:06:04.942
His identity is still being withheld
on a need to know basis.


00:06:05.042 --> 00:06:07.727
- And no one needs to know.
- He asked for you personally.


00:06:08.401 --> 00:06:10.786
- What's my cover?
- Trade show producer.


00:06:10.886 --> 00:06:14.328
Trade show? What show?
What show?


00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:15.668
It's gonna be huge.


00:06:16.175 --> 00:06:19.042
Tamerlane is sponsoring
a trade expo, Brand USA.


00:06:19.612 --> 00:06:22.396
It's our big launch bringing democracy
to this part of the world.


00:06:22.496 --> 00:06:25.564
We've bombed the shit out of them,
there's a lot of rebuilding to do.


00:06:25.664 --> 00:06:28.633
- Shows a nice spirit.
- Somebody has to help them.


00:06:28.733 --> 00:06:32.657
<i>This is a great opportunity
for Tamerlane and the U.S.</i>


00:06:33.159 --> 00:06:35.139
<i>Not to mention the
people of Turaqistan.</i>


00:06:35.239 --> 00:06:38.648
And to top it all off, there's gonna
be a gala wedding. Isn't that great?


00:06:38.748 --> 00:06:42.651
Seems like a pretty elaborate cover. I'm
gonna be responsible for all that shit?


00:06:42.751 --> 00:06:44.168
This is a historic moment.


00:06:44.904 --> 00:06:49.454
The first war ever to be 100%
outsourced to private enterprise.


00:06:49.554 --> 00:06:52.705
Tamerlane jets, Tamerlane
tanks, Tamerlane soldiers.


00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:56.147
And to top it all off,
the Brand USA expo.


00:06:56.716 --> 00:06:58.047
It's your show, baby.


00:07:54.207 --> 00:07:56.107
Welcome to the Turaqi
Green Zone, sir.


00:08:19.098 --> 00:08:23.000
<i>Tamerlane welcomes Expo
Turaqistan, Brand USA.</i>


00:08:41.487 --> 00:08:43.703
Welcome to Turaqistan, sir.
I'm Marsha Dillon...


00:08:43.803 --> 00:08:44.836
hoping you're
ready to kill.


00:08:44.936 --> 00:08:45.754
I've been briefed.


00:08:47.693 --> 00:08:49.126
SPF-Eighty-seven, sir.


00:08:49.962 --> 00:08:50.951
- Shall we?
- Yes.


00:09:00.373 --> 00:09:01.863
It all looks good.


00:09:03.709 --> 00:09:04.689
Great lights.


00:09:04.789 --> 00:09:05.992
<i>Take out the Tamercard.</i>


00:09:06.092 --> 00:09:07.010
What's your cover, by the way?


00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:11.129
Undergrad Wharton with a masters in
communication at the Annenberg School.


00:09:11.229 --> 00:09:12.650
- Very impressive.
- Well, it's fake.


00:09:13.853 --> 00:09:16.671
- Tell me that's not the stage?
- I think it is.


00:09:16.771 --> 00:09:17.984
East, honey, east.


00:09:18.724 --> 00:09:21.508
Do you want people turning away from
the stage to pray five times a day?


00:09:21.608 --> 00:09:24.062
Cultural sensitivity.
That's what we're about here.


00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:25.562
Sorry, sir.


00:09:28.367 --> 00:09:31.234
What exactly is wrong
with my credentials?


00:09:31.337 --> 00:09:33.965
I've been cleared. My
colleagues are going in.


00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:37.659
- Am I being singled out for some reason?
- I can't allow that.


00:09:37.759 --> 00:09:39.161
Very curious.


00:09:39.261 --> 00:09:42.631
- Find out who she is.
- Very curious situation.


00:09:42.731 --> 00:09:44.307
- Let's go, ma'am.
- Oh. Okay.


00:09:45.952 --> 00:09:47.715
And set up a meeting
with her in my office.


00:09:49.188 --> 00:09:50.678
Do I have an office?


00:09:51.958 --> 00:09:53.289
Great. Carry on.


00:09:53.392 --> 00:09:55.758
Yes, and I'll just try to
rearrange the entire place.


00:09:55.861 --> 00:09:57.351
- Just see if you can spin it.
- Yes.


00:10:01.367 --> 00:10:03.301
Ms. Hegalhuzen.


00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:12.534
Your 2:30's here.


00:10:14.547 --> 00:10:16.447
I read your piece in
"Atlantic Monthly".


00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.744
Very provocative.


00:10:19.652 --> 00:10:21.779
- Nice office.
- It's bulletproof.


00:10:26.092 --> 00:10:26.956
<i>Send her in.</i>


00:10:34.834 --> 00:10:38.793
Passion. This
is beautiful.


00:10:43.743 --> 00:10:44.573
Thank you!


00:10:45.077 --> 00:10:47.272
Hey, okay, okay,
we'll be in touch.


00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:49.793
- It's a gift. I brought a gift to you.
- Thank you.


00:10:49.893 --> 00:10:51.817
- It's a form of dance.
- Thank you. Good stuff.


00:10:51.917 --> 00:10:54.078
Pay-for-view TV.
Next week!


00:10:57.323 --> 00:10:58.702
And you are an angel.


00:10:58.802 --> 00:10:59.816
Thanks for the bag!


00:11:03.062 --> 00:11:04.142
Ms. "Hugelhazen".


00:11:04.242 --> 00:11:05.060
Hegalhuzen.


00:11:05.731 --> 00:11:08.015
- Hegalhuzen. Brand Hauser.
- Hello.


00:11:08.115 --> 00:11:09.046
- Hi.
- Hey.


00:11:09.146 --> 00:11:10.033
Come on in.


00:11:14.707 --> 00:11:15.501
Now...


00:11:17.443 --> 00:11:18.603
Holy shit!


00:11:21.013 --> 00:11:23.831
So, you're here to cover
our little trade show...


00:11:23.931 --> 00:11:27.317
"... that's being billed as
a liberating Turaqistan...


00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:31.049
satisfy the American consumer's
dreams just the opposite now.


00:11:31.157 --> 00:11:34.740
The proposed Expo Turaqistan offers
nothing more than the auctioning of...


00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:38.991
Turaqistan's future to the cause of
profit and international branding.


00:11:39.832 --> 00:11:41.216
Yeah, I remember that because I wrote it.


00:11:41.316 --> 00:11:43.950
There's no corruption here. Just
read the Silverman James Report.


00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:45.618
I have. It's bullshit.


00:11:45.718 --> 00:11:50.694
Look. We've already kicked out of this
place. What are we supposed to do?


00:11:50.794 --> 00:11:54.061
Turn our backs on all of the
entrepreneurial possibilities?


00:11:54.161 --> 00:11:58.640
Business is human response
to a moral or cosmic crisis.


00:11:59.218 --> 00:12:02.199
Whether it's a tsunami or a
sustained aerial bombardment...


00:12:02.299 --> 00:12:04.654
there's the same urgent
call for urban renewal.


00:12:06.592 --> 00:12:08.707
When did they start attacking
inside the Emerald City?


00:12:08.807 --> 00:12:10.159
I wouldn't call that an attack.


00:12:12.698 --> 00:12:15.258
Well, technically, that was a bombing.
At least it sounded like it was.


00:12:15.367 --> 00:12:17.335
Not an attack, which would
imply something else.


00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:20.229
Do you really think
I'm as bad as all this?


00:12:20.973 --> 00:12:22.770
- I don't know anything about you.
- Would you like to?


00:12:23.242 --> 00:12:23.920
It's my job.


00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:26.773
You make it sound so
tedious. Could be fun.


00:12:26.912 --> 00:12:29.244
- Then why don't I begin?
- Thought you'd never ask.


00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:33.015
Would you excuse me for one minute?


00:12:38.791 --> 00:12:40.782
- Call me soon.
- When?


00:12:40.893 --> 00:12:41.791
You'll feel it.


00:12:42.527 --> 00:12:45.678
- All righty then. Where were we?
- I haven't said anything yet.


00:12:45.778 --> 00:12:47.481
Excellent, 'cause I don't
remember hearing anything.


00:12:47.581 --> 00:12:49.682
- Then we're off to a great start.
- What can I do for you?


00:12:49.782 --> 00:12:53.261
Why do I have access?
Even on such a low level.


00:12:54.039 --> 00:12:54.898
Ouch.


00:12:55.441 --> 00:12:59.159
All my writings have called this
a violation of international law...


00:12:59.259 --> 00:13:00.803
and its practitioners are criminals.


00:13:01.313 --> 00:13:03.281
Do you really believe
all the stuff you write?


00:13:03.382 --> 00:13:06.078
Anyone who could cause this much
mayhem when he didn't have to?


00:13:06.919 --> 00:13:08.443
The amount of
suffering that I've seen?


00:13:09.255 --> 00:13:10.014
Hang on.


00:13:12.958 --> 00:13:14.220
Okay. Hold on a sec.


00:13:14.794 --> 00:13:16.178
But the way I look at it is this.


00:13:16.278 --> 00:13:20.148
The day we can actually feel and
hear all the suffering of mankind...


00:13:20.248 --> 00:13:22.427
that's the day when the
Christ will come back.


00:13:23.102 --> 00:13:25.730
So we got that going for us.
I'll be out in a minute.


00:13:27.006 --> 00:13:29.907
Or the Buddha, or Allah,
whoever floats your boat.


00:13:30.976 --> 00:13:31.965
Ms. Hagenhazel.


00:13:32.546 --> 00:13:33.963
- Call me Natalie.
- Natalie.


00:13:34.063 --> 00:13:37.675
I really must run. I feel like we're
on the verge of something important.


00:13:38.117 --> 00:13:41.780
Do you think we could continue
this conversation over drinks?


00:13:43.422 --> 00:13:45.049
- Drinks?
- Yeah, I know a friendly place.


00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.990
Marsha, will you set that up?
9, 10-ish?


00:14:04.343 --> 00:14:06.607
<i>Unattended cars will be
crushed and incinerated.</i>


00:14:10.783 --> 00:14:12.898
Hello, sir. Welcome to Popeye's.
How can I help you?


00:14:12.998 --> 00:14:17.170
I'll have crawfish étouffée, the Big
Flava chicken sandwich with Boss Sauce...


00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:19.816
and to top off my meal,
a frothy orange drink.


00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:23.353
- I'm here to see the viceroy.
- Sir.


00:14:23.462 --> 00:14:25.987
Don't mention his name.
Follow me!


00:14:33.539 --> 00:14:35.063
Okay!


00:14:41.046 --> 00:14:44.015
Let's go, boys.
One, two, one, two march!


00:15:05.971 --> 00:15:07.871
- He's not here?
- Closed circuit, sir.


00:15:09.074 --> 00:15:10.790
<i>Welcome to liberated
Turaqistan, Hauser.</i>


00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:12.456
<i>Big fan. Have been for ages.</i>


00:15:12.556 --> 00:15:13.889
<i>Sorry for the secret
identity bullshit...</i>


00:15:13.989 --> 00:15:15.573
<i>but it's a brave new security.</i>


00:15:16.048 --> 00:15:19.029
<i>I'll be contacting you by phone,
but if you wish to contact me...</i>


00:15:19.129 --> 00:15:20.983
<i>you'll have to come here
to the bunker, 'kay?</i>


00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:23.051
<i>Omar Sharif.</i>


00:15:23.151 --> 00:15:26.282
<i>He's staying at the Freedom
Grand through the closing ceremony.</i>


00:15:26.392 --> 00:15:27.689
<i>Make sure he doesn't
make his plane.</i>


00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:28.849
Got it.


00:15:28.861 --> 00:15:31.111
<i>Now, about this
closing ceremony...</i>


00:15:31.211 --> 00:15:33.858
<i>It looks like we Yonica Babyyeah
wedding. Incredible, huh?</i>


00:15:33.966 --> 00:15:35.715
What is a Yonica Babyyeah?


00:15:35.815 --> 00:15:37.359
<i>The Britney Spears
of Central Asia.</i>


00:15:37.469 --> 00:15:39.921
<i>Kids from Baca to Yemen
are nuts for her.</i>


00:15:40.021 --> 00:15:41.654
<i>Anyway. The point is...</i>


00:15:41.754 --> 00:15:44.024
<i>this weddin' is the grand
finale of the trade show.</i>


00:15:44.124 --> 00:15:47.529
<i>This is the biggest extravaganza
in the history of Central Asia.</i>


00:15:47.629 --> 00:15:49.497
<i>And it's the centerpiece
of our P.R. blitz here.</i>


00:15:49.597 --> 00:15:51.343
<i>It's perfect branding synergy, Hauser.</i>


00:15:51.483 --> 00:15:55.201
Blends the image of an American-style
woman getting her own and getting it on.


00:15:55.301 --> 00:15:56.604
A great new
democratic dynasty...


00:15:56.704 --> 00:16:00.238
with all the strength and
virility of traditional warlords.


00:16:00.338 --> 00:16:02.440
<i>Exactly.
That's why you're the best.</i>


00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.542
<i>Overall, we see it as a
pretty irresistible package.</i>


00:16:05.642 --> 00:16:08.828
<i>We're getting worldwide coverage, U.S.
networks, Sky Channel, Al Jazeera...</i>


00:16:08.934 --> 00:16:09.981
<i>so make it big buddy.</i>


00:16:10.081 --> 00:16:12.718
<i>See she gets everything she wants
and make this a grand finale...</i>


00:16:12.818 --> 00:16:13.986
<i>the world will never forget.</i>


00:16:14.186 --> 00:16:14.932
You bet.


00:16:15.674 --> 00:16:19.527
Jeff? So, listen. I met this guy...
No, he's just some mid-level schmo.


00:16:19.627 --> 00:16:23.498
Anyway, I think if I play him right, I
can get a pass out of the Green Zone...


00:16:23.598 --> 00:16:25.642
and I can see what's
really going on here.


00:16:26.285 --> 00:16:27.274
No chip for me, thanks.


00:16:27.386 --> 00:16:29.320
Ma'am, you really won't get the
full experience without the chip.


00:16:29.421 --> 00:16:31.137
Doctor's orders.
I get hives.


00:16:31.237 --> 00:16:33.940
<i>Welcome to Implanted
Journalist Experience.</i>


00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:36.927
<i>Thanks to cutting-edge Tamerlane
Interactive Technology...</i>


00:16:37.029 --> 00:16:41.762
<i>we are now able to reduce the risk of
journalist mortality to virtually zero.</i>


00:16:42.267 --> 00:16:45.018
<i>The Combat-o-Rama
Implantation Device...</i>


00:16:45.118 --> 00:16:48.687
<i>will allow you to experience
full spectrum sensory reality.</i>


00:16:48.787 --> 00:16:51.558
<i>Over the next seventy-two hours,
some of you may experience...</i>


00:16:51.658 --> 00:16:54.271
<i>headaches, nausea and some
muscle pain. This is normal.</i>


00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:57.076
<i>If symptoms of epilepsy occur,
please notify your doctor.</i>


00:16:57.649 --> 00:16:58.707
<i>Thanks and enjoy the ride.</i>


00:17:31.283 --> 00:17:32.008
<i>Mr. Hauser!</i>


00:17:33.052 --> 00:17:33.848
<i>Mr. Hauser!</i>


00:17:33.952 --> 00:17:37.911
Yonica Baby is two minutes
from arrival. We need to go.


00:18:37.616 --> 00:18:39.641
Yonica!
I love you!


00:18:47.359 --> 00:18:48.519
Jesus Christ.


00:18:50.028 --> 00:18:51.676
Hi. Welcome. How
was traffic?


00:18:51.776 --> 00:18:53.513
I hear those checkpoints
can be murder.


00:18:53.613 --> 00:18:56.580
Where is dressing room?
I'm fucking wasted.


00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:57.580
Well, let me show you.


00:18:57.680 --> 00:18:59.554
She needs Popeye ten-piece box.
All white meat.


00:18:59.654 --> 00:19:02.129
Extra crispy, extra spicy.
Diet Coke. You get it?


00:19:02.741 --> 00:19:03.867
And pickles.


00:19:04.476 --> 00:19:06.557
She wants pickles.
Clausen classic dill pickles.


00:19:06.657 --> 00:19:07.860
- Pickles?
- Yeah.


00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:10.710
- All right...
- You are big boss?


00:19:11.583 --> 00:19:13.642
- I guess I am, yeah.
- How big?


00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:15.602
Don't do that.


00:19:15.702 --> 00:19:16.984
Confiscate that film.


00:19:18.523 --> 00:19:20.320
I do what I want.
Okay?


00:19:20.425 --> 00:19:22.175
Of course you do and we're
excited to have you.


00:19:22.275 --> 00:19:23.043
Don't get too excited.


00:19:23.143 --> 00:19:25.221
I'm not that excited. Let me
show you to your dressing room.


00:19:25.664 --> 00:19:27.689
Get some chicken, pickles.
and whatever you want.


00:19:28.534 --> 00:19:30.399
Come on in. Hi.
Nice work with the bat.


00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:33.235
How are you? Hi, good luck.


