01:15:47.376 --> 01:15:48.153
American?


01:15:48.253 --> 01:15:50.838
We have three. Two yellow
hair and one dark hair.


01:15:50.946 --> 01:15:51.935
Dark hair.


01:15:56.652 --> 01:15:57.477
Where?


01:16:00.756 --> 01:16:01.723
Show me.


01:16:14.469 --> 01:16:22.433
10? No. How about 20?
Okay. It's a deal.


01:16:23.545 --> 01:16:25.308
Shut up!
Let's do it.


01:16:34.289 --> 01:16:36.154
Don't shoot, man!


01:16:37.859 --> 01:16:39.588
Hey, we're sorry. Chill.


01:16:39.695 --> 01:16:41.545
I'm sorry, just take the girl.
We don't want the girl.


01:16:41.645 --> 01:16:43.914
We just, we do movies, man.
We love to make movies.


01:16:44.014 --> 01:16:45.193
Yeah, yeah, movies.


01:16:46.068 --> 01:16:47.592
Don't get up, guys.
We gotta run.


01:16:52.240 --> 01:16:54.504
Fuck, dude. That was intense.


01:16:57.012 --> 01:16:59.207
Okay. We're okay.


01:17:05.087 --> 01:17:08.079
Next time bring
some candy asshole.


01:17:09.725 --> 01:17:13.674
<i>Mr. Hauser? I told you Fallaf
was not a good idea, didn't I?</i>


01:17:13.774 --> 01:17:16.845
<i>It's a no-go zone.
And you went.</i>


01:17:16.945 --> 01:17:18.399
<i>That was not a good idea.</i>


01:17:29.511 --> 01:17:30.268
Get down!


01:17:33.714 --> 01:17:34.471
Go.


01:17:40.322 --> 01:17:42.756
Could you please try
to call Natalie again?


01:17:48.897 --> 01:17:50.545
What the fuck is wrong with you?


01:17:50.645 --> 01:17:52.646
What, my English
not so good?


01:17:52.746 --> 01:17:54.224
Come on.
I love you.


01:17:56.638 --> 01:17:59.072
Come on here.
Come on here.


01:18:10.185 --> 01:18:12.710
Get down, get down!


01:18:18.293 --> 01:18:19.260
Get up.


01:18:39.614 --> 01:18:40.829
Hey, you in charge?


01:18:40.929 --> 01:18:44.032
- Who the fuck's in charge?
- No one! I'm no one!


01:18:44.132 --> 01:18:46.553
- What are you lookin' at, bitch?
- I'm no one!


01:20:07.068 --> 01:20:10.128
A couple of quick announcements.


01:20:10.705 --> 01:20:14.436
The panel discussion, the Redemptive
Power of the Hedge Fund Derivative...


01:20:14.910 --> 01:20:17.242
has been moved to the mini ballroom.


01:20:17.746 --> 01:20:21.238
Don't forget to go to the Meet
and Greet cocktail reception...


01:20:21.783 --> 01:20:26.618
at the Tiki Room at five
and pick up your gift bags.


01:20:27.022 --> 01:20:31.308
They've got a coffee mug
and a desert umbrella...


01:20:31.408 --> 01:20:33.725
foam beer
Koozie and a...


01:20:34.728 --> 01:20:37.243
autographed copy
from you know who...


01:20:37.343 --> 01:20:41.200
of "How I Conquered the World and
Worked Out Issues With My Dad".


01:21:34.089 --> 01:21:35.113
Take care of the kid.


01:21:36.892 --> 01:21:38.257
'Cause I might have to go too.


01:21:42.597 --> 01:21:43.689
You don't have to.


01:21:45.967 --> 01:21:46.797
Yes, I do.


01:23:20.628 --> 01:23:21.458
Natalie.


01:23:21.963 --> 01:23:25.524
I saw your face and
creation held its breath.


01:23:26.201 --> 01:23:27.463
I'm coming.


01:23:31.906 --> 01:23:33.874
No, no, no...


01:23:41.149 --> 01:23:43.933
Silly me. I was expecting
a beautiful woman.


01:23:44.033 --> 01:23:44.781
Sorry.


01:23:45.253 --> 01:23:45.981
Hauser...


01:23:46.654 --> 01:23:49.088
Love does get one into
difficult situations.


01:23:50.025 --> 01:23:51.253
Somebody's gonna kill you.


01:23:53.761 --> 01:23:54.785
It was supposed to be me.


01:23:56.297 --> 01:23:57.525
Triple your security.


01:23:58.833 --> 01:23:59.993
Stay off the streets.


01:24:00.602 --> 01:24:03.036
With a little skill you
may actually stay alive.


01:24:15.784 --> 01:24:18.082
- How may I thank you?
- No need.


01:24:26.194 --> 01:24:28.662
We're in a constant
state of war, Hauser.


01:24:29.664 --> 01:24:31.712
We kill our brothers,
complete strangers...


01:24:31.812 --> 01:24:32.960
the guilty and the innocent.


01:24:34.637 --> 01:24:36.662
We are at war with
our own hearts.


01:24:37.138 --> 01:24:39.936
Love is a cease-fire
that's destined to fail.


01:24:40.708 --> 01:24:42.869
But, as I said...


01:24:43.745 --> 01:24:46.213
it does get us into
tricky situations.


01:24:48.616 --> 01:24:51.050
Sometimes the back
of a garbage truck.


01:24:56.057 --> 01:24:58.890
The ultimate Chickenhawk
is roosting close-by.


01:25:06.768 --> 01:25:07.632
Good luck.


01:25:20.949 --> 01:25:22.576
She says she's a bridesmaid.


01:25:24.785 --> 01:25:27.913
- You got an extra dress?
- Yes.


01:25:29.557 --> 01:25:30.819
<i>For all of us at Tamerlane...</i>


01:25:31.459 --> 01:25:34.176
<i>I extend a heartfelt
good luck and God bless...</i>


01:25:34.276 --> 01:25:35.695
<i>whoever that god may be.</i>


01:25:36.197 --> 01:25:38.563
<i>To our happy young couple.
Shalom.</i>


01:25:40.335 --> 01:25:41.058
<i>Shit.</i>


01:26:05.059 --> 01:26:07.118
We have someone to do
your hair and makeup.


01:26:08.096 --> 01:26:09.495
I could do this.


01:26:10.198 --> 01:26:11.665
Sit down!


01:26:14.169 --> 01:26:15.158
Clean yourself!


01:26:19.240 --> 01:26:22.732
We gotta go to the viceroy.
Where the hell is Hauser?


01:26:24.245 --> 01:26:25.007
Asshole.


01:26:27.682 --> 01:26:28.439
All right.


01:26:32.253 --> 01:26:36.189
I am going to tell that bastard that
I want to go shopping in America.


01:26:36.723 --> 01:26:39.749
And I never come back.
Can I stay with you?


01:26:40.395 --> 01:26:42.590
Yes. Yes. Yes.


01:26:57.378 --> 01:26:58.345
It's time.


01:27:22.237 --> 01:27:25.555
Where are you?
I wanna see you.


01:27:25.655 --> 01:27:28.188
<i>Hauser. I'm about to
address the weddin'.</i>


01:27:28.288 --> 01:27:30.176
<i>You're just gonna have
to wait 'til I'm done.</i>


01:27:30.678 --> 01:27:31.906
I've waited long enough.


01:27:48.563 --> 01:27:49.655
Hauser.


01:27:50.898 --> 01:27:54.664
Hello, Walken.
You look fabulous.


01:27:55.336 --> 01:27:56.735
How did you know?


01:27:57.338 --> 01:27:59.183
Where else would you be?


01:27:59.283 --> 01:28:01.389
And going to the
Viceroy in five...


01:28:01.489 --> 01:28:04.001
four, three, two...


01:28:04.812 --> 01:28:07.163
<i>Wonderful opportunities
here, Hauser.</i>


01:28:07.263 --> 01:28:11.548
<i>As long as these towel-heads don't
look up freedom in the dictionary.</i>


01:28:11.653 --> 01:28:16.507
<i>To use one of your own homespun colloquialisms
let's cut the shit, shall we?</i>


01:28:16.607 --> 01:28:17.806
That is your viceroy?


01:28:17.906 --> 01:28:20.554
You know what your problem is, Hauser?
You're a moralist.


01:28:20.662 --> 01:28:23.514
That's why you're so
much fun to fuck with.


01:28:23.614 --> 01:28:28.148
War is the improvement of
investments by other means.


01:28:28.248 --> 01:28:32.570
For dummies. The USA is a
subdivision of Tamerlane.


01:28:32.674 --> 01:28:36.121
Democracy, the war on
terror, the war on drugs...


01:28:36.221 --> 01:28:39.338
these are all focus group
slogans for Tamerlane.


01:28:39.447 --> 01:28:44.578
You murdered my wife.
And I'm here to kill you for that.


01:28:44.685 --> 01:28:48.746
You were such a superb
killing machine, Hauser.


01:28:48.856 --> 01:28:49.823
What happened to you?


01:28:50.626 --> 01:28:52.560
You've had a whole week to kill Omar.


01:28:53.061 --> 01:28:57.178
Of course I could have liquidated you
after you thought you'd killed me.


01:28:57.278 --> 01:29:00.814
Right after I tried to kiss you and
you threw me in the garbage truck.


01:29:00.914 --> 01:29:05.703
It's gonna be hard to torture
someone who's mostly dead.


01:29:06.908 --> 01:29:08.671
But I'm gonna try...


01:29:10.645 --> 01:29:11.759
to enjoy it.


01:29:11.859 --> 01:29:16.249
But, by killing the woman
and kidnapping the girl...


01:29:16.351 --> 01:29:17.181
Oh, my God.


01:29:17.285 --> 01:29:19.001
<i>...that was so much more satisfying.</i>


01:29:19.101 --> 01:29:21.715
I left you in a state
of constant agony.


01:29:21.823 --> 01:29:26.226
<i>You ever wonder what the ideology
of vibrio cholerae bacterium...</i>


01:29:26.327 --> 01:29:31.811
<i>or the system of Yersinia pestis the
bacteria that causes bubonic plague.</i>


01:29:31.911 --> 01:29:33.127
I'll tell you, Hauser.


01:29:33.868 --> 01:29:35.426
Perpetuation.


01:29:35.970 --> 01:29:38.029
An infinite succession of generations.


01:29:38.139 --> 01:29:40.334
Immortality on the installment plan.


01:29:40.441 --> 01:29:42.624
I wish I had that
sort of esprit d'corps.


01:29:42.724 --> 01:29:44.645
That bacterial team spirit.


01:29:45.480 --> 01:29:49.746
Talk about legacy.
Talk about empire.


01:29:50.785 --> 01:29:54.346
You're gonna tell me
what you did with her...


01:29:56.524 --> 01:29:57.991
then I'm gonna kill you again.


01:29:58.626 --> 01:30:00.821
- Do you understand, old man?
- Don't you get it?


01:30:01.662 --> 01:30:03.027
Your daughter happens...


01:30:07.602 --> 01:30:09.035
Shut it down!


01:30:10.538 --> 01:30:12.165
<i>Your daughter, Hauser.</i>


01:30:16.878 --> 01:30:24.250
Your daughter is about to be married.
And, Daddy you're the father of the bride.


01:30:28.289 --> 01:30:31.087
God, that's a
conversation stopper.


01:30:32.260 --> 01:30:34.751
Well, you just sit back
and enjoy the show.


01:30:35.563 --> 01:30:38.123
You must be a real proud daddy.


01:30:41.002 --> 01:30:42.060
Here she comes.


01:30:46.340 --> 01:30:48.706
Ain't you the proudest daddy?
Look at that.


01:30:49.076 --> 01:30:50.168
She turned out good.


01:30:50.578 --> 01:30:54.810
She looks good in that white dress
and those little white boots.


01:30:59.053 --> 01:31:01.749
A white dress
and white boots.


01:31:07.195 --> 01:31:08.025
Oh, look at that.


01:31:08.596 --> 01:31:10.947
Don't you think the little
whore turned out well?


01:31:11.047 --> 01:31:14.548
I promised her Daddy would
be here. And here you are.


01:31:14.648 --> 01:31:15.432
Shoot him!


01:31:16.270 --> 01:31:18.101
The father of the bride!


01:31:46.667 --> 01:31:48.726
Hauser!
Where are you, Hauser?


01:31:49.604 --> 01:31:52.585
Come on, fight me like a dude.
Face me Hauser.


01:31:52.685 --> 01:31:53.619
Come on!


01:31:53.719 --> 01:31:56.404
I can control all of
this with my eyes.


01:32:35.816 --> 01:32:36.610
Yonica!


01:32:38.819 --> 01:32:40.081
- Yonica.
- Shut the fuck up!


01:32:41.489 --> 01:32:43.218
- Yonica. Yonica.
- Shut the fuck up! Shut up.


01:32:45.993 --> 01:32:46.925
Get done, come on.


01:32:47.728 --> 01:32:51.778
Dearly beloved, friends,
believers and infidels.


01:32:51.878 --> 01:32:53.424
We are gathered here today...


01:32:54.101 --> 01:32:58.021
to join together in holy
matrimony this man and this...


01:32:58.121 --> 01:33:01.336
Yonica! Yonica!


01:33:01.442 --> 01:33:02.201
Hauser!


01:33:09.050 --> 01:33:12.542
You can't do this.
I won't let you.


01:33:14.755 --> 01:33:15.881
I'm your father.


01:33:19.327 --> 01:33:20.084
Catch him.


01:33:24.698 --> 01:33:25.494
It's me.


01:33:27.702 --> 01:33:29.932
I've loved you since the
minute you were born.


01:33:30.538 --> 01:33:31.732
I will kill you!


01:33:41.148 --> 01:33:42.274
It's gonna be okay.


01:33:58.499 --> 01:34:00.467
We're gonna be a family again.


01:34:18.619 --> 01:34:21.952
Come on!


01:34:32.800 --> 01:34:34.516
Yonica, Yonica.


01:34:34.616 --> 01:34:35.762
Let go of that!
Don't do that.


01:34:37.304 --> 01:34:38.771
What's going on?


01:34:42.743 --> 01:34:43.537
Go, go, go, go, go!


01:34:43.812 --> 01:34:44.676
Go, go, go!


01:34:51.652 --> 01:34:55.179
Get me back to the bunker.
Headset.


01:34:56.257 --> 01:34:57.690
Get me a tomahawk.


01:34:58.792 --> 01:35:00.677
Blow this whole fuckin' place to shit.


01:35:00.777 --> 01:35:01.538
Yes, sir.


01:35:01.638 --> 01:35:04.792
Terrorists at the weddin'.
We've got 'em cornered.


01:35:05.499 --> 01:35:07.490
So close to the bunker
could be dangerous, sir.


01:35:08.402 --> 01:35:10.495
Haven't you heard of
a surgical strike?


01:35:12.473 --> 01:35:14.168
- Launch it.
- Firing two-one.


01:35:28.289 --> 01:35:30.655
Viceroy coming through.
Viceroy coming through.


01:35:32.593 --> 01:35:34.652
You should have let
me finish the job!


01:35:49.777 --> 01:35:52.696
Tamerlane weapons are
precision-guided...


01:35:52.796 --> 01:35:54.680
to minimize
collateral damage.


01:35:55.616 --> 01:35:59.347
Not only is our technology the
most advanced in the world...


01:35:59.487 --> 01:36:02.536
but also with a smart
missile system...


01:36:02.636 --> 01:36:05.504
we can launch a matchstick
in Milwaukee...


01:36:05.604 --> 01:36:09.325
and stick it up the ass
of termite in Tehran.


01:36:25.780 --> 01:36:26.974
Shit happens.


01:36:36.757 --> 01:36:37.815
This blows.


01:36:39.493 --> 01:36:42.587
"Killer, Whores and Jackals.
Behind Brand USA".


01:36:42.696 --> 01:36:43.579
Good title, huh?


01:36:43.679 --> 01:36:44.513
It's a little wordy.


01:36:44.613 --> 01:36:45.690
Vehicle from the front!


01:36:48.235 --> 01:36:49.725
All right, that's it! Hold it!


01:36:53.574 --> 01:36:57.169
We are going to honeymoon.


01:36:59.146 --> 01:37:01.546
Dude, it's the newlyweds!


01:37:01.650 --> 01:37:02.465
Hey! Stand down!


01:37:02.565 --> 01:37:07.112
Yonica, congratulations.
Your chariot's right this way.


01:37:07.655 --> 01:37:08.553
Thank you.


01:37:09.223 --> 01:37:11.987
- I have your poster on my wall.
- No, he's lyin'. It's my wall.


01:37:12.526 --> 01:37:14.653
I used to... no. Bye.


01:37:29.243 --> 01:37:30.471
Run, run, run.


01:37:31.011 --> 01:37:31.978
Run, run, run.


01:37:35.749 --> 01:37:37.580
I cannot fucking believe this.


01:37:39.787 --> 01:37:43.707
Yonica, I know I saved you but I don't
want you putting me up on a pedestal.


01:37:43.807 --> 01:37:45.506
I'm just a person, just a man.


01:37:45.606 --> 01:37:47.026
Are you crazy? Where have you been?


01:37:47.995 --> 01:37:50.725
- You are a fucking asshole, you know?
- Oh, I feel much better.


01:37:51.632 --> 01:37:52.826
Go. Turn this thing on!


01:37:58.372 --> 01:38:01.353
<i>So you don't want her to
be an assassin like you.</i>


01:38:01.453 --> 01:38:03.922
<i>Well, don't worry because
I want to be like you.</i>


01:38:04.022 --> 01:38:05.535
<i>- Yonica, don't be so sarcastic.
- I'm not.</i>


01:38:07.414 --> 01:38:09.905
<i>- Where are we going?
- I don't know.</i>


01:38:10.451 --> 01:38:11.767
<i>What do you mean, I don't know?</i>


01:38:11.867 --> 01:38:13.501
<i>When I said I don't know,
it means I don't know.</i>


01:38:13.601 --> 01:38:15.215
<i>- GuideStar!
- Welcome back, Mr. Hauser.</i>


01:38:15.322 --> 01:38:17.313
<i>I can book you an hotel,
make you a dinner reservation.</i>


01:38:17.424 --> 01:38:18.639
<i>You wanna just be spontaneous?</i>


01:38:18.739 --> 01:38:22.011
<i>Spontaneous? It's Memorial Day
weekend, what if everything's full?</i>


01:38:22.111 --> 01:38:23.980
<i>It's not gonna be full.
Jerry, am I right?</i>


01:38:24.080 --> 01:38:25.611
<i>Don't get Jerry involved in this.</i>


01:38:25.711 --> 01:38:27.516
Would you two stop fighting?


01:38:27.616 --> 01:38:29.418
We're not fighting.
We're just discussing.


01:38:29.518 --> 01:38:31.388
<i>- It be sounding like fighting.
- Now she hates fighting.</i>


01:38:31.488 --> 01:38:33.269
<i>Well, what do you expect?
Look at her father!</i>


01:38:33.374 --> 01:38:35.388
This is the former vice
president speaking.


01:38:35.488 --> 01:38:38.896
In response to the cowardly
and unprovoked terrorist...


01:38:38.996 --> 01:38:40.695
attack on the Emerald
City mall...


01:38:40.795 --> 01:38:44.465
Tamerlane is pleased to announce
that it has been awarded the contract...


01:38:44.565 --> 01:38:46.280
to preemptively strike Ugikistan...


01:38:46.921 --> 01:38:49.435
which intelligence has
confirmed is behind this...


01:38:49.535 --> 01:38:51.457
and hundreds of other
attacks in Turaqistan.


01:38:51.992 --> 01:38:55.541
America cannot stand idly by and
allow hostile foreign powers...


01:38:55.641 --> 01:38:57.460
to meddle in Turaqi affairs.


01:38:57.865 --> 01:38:59.682
Intelligence has also conclusively stated...


01:38:59.782 --> 01:39:03.119
that the Ugikis are developing
a nuclear arsenal...


01:39:03.219 --> 01:39:06.866
and we cannot let the smoking gun come
in the form of a mushroom cloud.

